  options:
  - optionText: They're near the border between Arkansas and Tennessee. Baxton told
      me about them, and I went there myself. I saw them with my own eyes.
    replyText: 'That''s very good news for the United States. Unfortunately, we don''t
      have any oil specialists right now. We''ll have to deal with it later. Here''s
      $500 and a First Aid Kit. That''s all I can give you right now. And one more
      thing: don''t tell Baxton that you found the oil fields.'
